it 构建零信任 AI 智能体","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google 开源了基于 ADK 和 Gemini 的零信任客服与退货智能体示例，演示如何防御提示注入等攻击。该架构在 LLM 上下文之外通过三层硬性安全机制保障：硬件支持的加密签名确保数据库写入不可抵赖、gVisor 沙箱隔离动态代码执行、确定性语义网关校验业务逻辑。系统提示词只是软约束，无法作为安全边界。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxv0p3v0bntroz0227a6b3j","originalUrl":"https://developers.googleblog.com/build-zero-trust-ai-agents-with-googles-agent-development-kit","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-b2g4tp","originalSourceName":"Google Developers Blog（RSS）","family":"google","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxv0p3v0bntroz0227a6b3j","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-b2g4tp","name":"Google Developers Blog（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Google 开源了基于 ADK 和 Gemini 的零信任客服与退货智能体示例，演示如何防御提示注入等攻击。该架构在 LLM 上下文之外通过三层硬性安全机制保障：硬件支持的加密签名确保数据库写入不可抵赖、gVisor 沙箱隔离动态代码执行、确定性语义网关校验业务逻辑。系统提示词只是软约束，无法作为安全边界。","reportEdition":"2026-08-18","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxfcx2n036jroi2rxg0tdmq","title":"开源模型生态的未来：Nvidia 押注“教所有人炼 token”","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsxfcx2n036jroi2rxg0tdmq","https://www.interconnects.ai/p/teaching-everyone-to-fish-for-tokens"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsxfcx2n036jroi2rxg0tdmq","title":"开源模型生态的未来：Nvidia 押注“教所有人炼 token”","originalTitle":"","summary":"开源模型生态正日益依赖 Nvidia 的资助，其已投入 260 亿美元推动近乎开源的模型开发，以扩大推理芯片需求。若此路径不奏效，开源模型将转向效率、可修改性等长尾场景，与闭源模型分化。同时，基础模型训练门槛升高，开源社区兴趣正从全量训练转向对 DeepSeek V4 Flash、GLM 5.X 等模型的微调。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxfcx2n036jroi2rxg0tdmq","originalUrl":"https://www.interconnects.ai/p/teaching-everyone-to-fish-for-tokens","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-gw7nds","originalSourceName":"Nathan Lambert：Interconnects（RSS）","family":"outlet-1h63bhw","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxfcx2n036jroi2rxg0tdmq","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-gw7nds","name":"Nathan Lambert：Interconnects（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"开源模型生态正日益依赖 Nvidia 的资助，其已投入 260 亿美元推动近乎开源的模型开发，以扩大推理芯片需求。若此路径不奏效，开源模型将转向效率、可修改性等长尾场景，与闭源模型分化。同时，基础模型训练门槛升高，开源社区兴趣正从全量训练转向对 DeepSeek V4 Flash、GLM 5.X 等模型的微调。","reportEdition":"2026-08-18","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxnxhxa05wjroz0grlpa8a9","title":"同一集群利用率提升 33 个百分点：改变的是分配顺序","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsxnxhxa05wjroz0grlpa8a9","https://huggingface.co/blog/Dharma-AI/gpu-management-pt2"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsxnxhxa05wjroz0grlpa8a9","title":"同一集群利用率提升 33 个百分点：改变的是分配顺序","originalTitle":"","summary":"Hugging Face 构建了一个约束感知的 GPU 分配器，并在七个基准场景中与 FIFO 调度器对比。在相同硬件和负载下，GPU 利用率最高提升 33 个百分点，优先级加权输出在全部场景中均上升，最高达 105%。分配器将实时推理需求按曲线而非峰值处理，批量任务按优先级跨整个调度周期排序，从而回收了预留闲置容量。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxnxhxa05wjroz0grlpa8a9","originalUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/Dharma-AI/gpu-management-pt2","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-rb89q4","originalSourceName":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxnxhxa05wjroz0grlpa8a9","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Hugging Face 构建了一个约束感知的 GPU 分配器，并在七个基准场景中与 FIFO 调度器对比。在相同硬件和负载下，GPU 利用率最高提升 33 个百分点，优先级加权输出在全部场景中均上升，最高达 105%。分配器将实时推理需求按曲线而非峰值处理，批量任务按优先级跨整个调度周期排序，从而回收了预留闲置容量。","reportEdition":"2026-08-18","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxi809j02vnroswjnpyp2gv","title":"ABC Legal 如何借助 Claude Managed Agents 让每位员工成为构建者","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsxi809j02vnroswjnpyp2gv","https://claude.com/blog/how-abc-legal-turned-every-employee-into-a-builder-with-claude-managed-agents"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsxi809j02vnroswjnpyp2gv","title":"ABC Legal 如何借助 Claude Managed Agents 让每位员工成为构建者","originalTitle":"","summary":"ABC Legal 为 1,100 名员工部署 Claude Enterprise 后，通过 Claude Managed Agents 将零散实验转变为受治理的智能体体系，截至 2026 年 7 月已上线 50 多个生产级智能体，部分覆盖的人工任务成本降低约 50%，约 310 名员工日常使用 Claude。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxi809j02vnroswjnpyp2gv","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/how-abc-legal-turned-every-employee-into-a-builder-with-claude-managed-agents","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxi809j02vnroswjnpyp2gv","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"ABC Legal 为 1,100 名员工部署 Claude Enterprise 后，通过 Claude Managed Agents 将零散实验转变为受治理的智能体体系，截至 2026 年 7 月已上线 50 多个生产级智能体，部分覆盖的人工任务成本降低约 50%，约 310 名员工日常使用 Claude。","reportEdition":"2026-08-18","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxj97e9016aroz080y9zfto","title":"当模型持续学习：测试时训练如何改变 AI 的记忆与成本","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsxj97e9016aroz080y9zfto","https://www.tomtunguz.com/test-time-training-impact"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsxj97e9016aroz080y9zfto","title":"当模型持续学习：测试时训练如何改变 AI 的记忆与成本","originalTitle":"","summary":"测试时训练（Test-time training）让模型在使用中持续更新权重，而非训练结束后冻结。相比标准 Transformer，其内存需求从随上下文线性增长变为恒定，斯坦福研究显示推理速度最高可提升 2.7 倍，且 In-Place TTT 无需重训即可将 4B 模型提升至 128k 上下文性能。但代价是每个用户需独立模型副本，服务成本转向算力与芯片，更适合编码助手等个性化场景。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxj97e9016aroz080y9zfto","originalUrl":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/test-time-training-impact","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-uw5ga9","originalSourceName":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","family":"outlet-eygl44","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxj97e9016aroz080y9zfto","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-uw5ga9","name":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"测试时训练（Test-time training）让模型在使用中持续更新权重，而非训练结束后冻结。相比标准 Transformer，其内存需求从随上下文线性增长变为恒定，斯坦福研究显示推理速度最高可提升 2.7 倍，且 In-Place TTT 无需重训即可将 4B 模型提升至 128k 上下文性能。但代价是每个用户需独立模型副本，服务成本转向算力与芯片，更适合编码助手等个性化场景。","reportEdition":"2026-08-18","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsxjbtk6018lroz0ywmuve4h","title":"SGLang 重构 CUDA Graph 支持，Breakable CUDA Graph 成 prefill 默认方案","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T00:00:17.730Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsxjbtk6018lroz0ywmuve4h","https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-08-17-advanced-cuda-graph"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsxjbtk6018lroz0ywmuve4h","title":"SGLang 重构 CUDA Graph 支持，Breakable CUDA Graph 成 prefill 默认方案","originalTitle":"","summary":"SGLan